[statement]
A record that conflicts with itself is a package all the same: a later
repository offering the same package again, without the provide, adds
nothing, and apk, asked for `f`, chooses the first record and refuses.

[repository]
P:f
V:3
p:f

[repository]
P:f
V:3

[request]
f

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
| ERROR: unable to select packages:
|   f-3:
|     conflicts: f-3[f]
|     satisfies: world[f]
refused
